##
## NovatOS — packages.x86_64
## Minimal Hyprland-based live ISO.
## Design goal: idle RAM < 350 MB on 2009-era hardware (2 GB RAM minimum).
## Heavy apps (Steam, LibreOffice, Lutris, etc.) are NOT shipped on the ISO —
## users install them on demand through the bauh app store, which unifies
## AUR + Flatpak + Snap + AppImage + Web Apps behind one GUI.
##

